    "proves": "Missing desired state awareness training scenario.\nVerifies that the 4-layer state model holds in the quickstart cluster:\nLayer 3 (installed in etcd) and Layer 4 (systemd runtime) must be\nindependently observable.\n\nNote: In the quickstart lab topology, packages are pre-installed in the\ncontainer image and NOT registered via the Globular package system.\nLayer 3 (installed packages in etcd) will therefore be empty.\nThis is a known lab exception: quickstart.topology_lab_only_exception.\n\nThis scenario tests what IS observable: Layer 4 (services active) and\nthat etcd write quorum is intact. It does not assert Layer 3 parity\nbecause that requires a full Globular package deployment cycle.",
